        "@value": "ᑲᓇᑕᒥ ᓄᓇᖃᖅᑳᖅᓯᒪᔪᑦ ᐃᓄᐃᑦ ᐅᓪᓗᖓ  National Indigenous Peoples Day Concert — Alianait"
      }
    ],
    "http://ogp.me/ns#latitude": [
