      {
        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Live from the virtual stage is a double bill of Iqaluit awesomeness! Tune in to hear Iqaluit rapper FXCKMR return to the Alianait stage, followed by the Arctic Soul heavyweights Josh Q. &amp; the Tradeoffs for the second instalment of our Northern Concert Series.&nbsp;"
