        "@language": "en-ca",
        "@value": "Back to Iqaluit by popular demand,  Beatrice Deer  is a singer, seamstress and advocate for good health from the tiny Nunavik village of Quaqtaq. Beatrice has four albums under her belt, including an award winner for Best Inuit Cultural Album at the Canadian Aboriginal Music Awards.  We’re excited f"
